StoreForce mobile app is the app designed for Retail Operations on-the-go. It provides you with real-time insights from across your Retail estate, the ability schedule staff and run time and attendance, assign tasks, view reports and much more.

Key features:
• Real-time KPI dashboards;
• Sorting by standard and alternative hierarchies;
• KPI Statistics;
• Complete At-a-Glance functionality (including Task, Events, Rankings, Store Profile Reports, and Messaging);
• Ability to complete your Store Visit reports
• In-app viewing of Published reports;
• Store Scheduling and Time & Attendance.

IMPORTANT. In order for you to use this application, the following must be considered:
• Your employer must be a StoreForce client;
• Your employer’s StoreForce Installation must be configured to allow access from mobile devices; and
• Mobile Access must be switched on for you as an individual user.

ABOUT STOREFORCE. StoreForce provides Specialty Retailers with the Essential Toolset they need to manage day-to-day Retail Operations, drive Employee and Store Performance, and increase Company Revenue. The StoreForce Solution combines labor scheduling, time & attendance, real-time KPI analytics and statistics, target management, task management, and a full-featured business intelligence solution into a single, mobile Software Toolset built for everyone from the Store Manager to the CEO. StoreForce Tablet is an extension of the web-based StoreForce Application that offers select features and functionality for Operators on-the-go.
